"description\" content=\"Cherly turns photos of your real clothes into an AI stylist — complete outfits from clothes you actually own, tuned to your taste, your calendar, and the weather.\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Privacy Policy · Cherly\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Cherly turns photos of your real clothes into an AI stylist — complete outfits from clothes you actually own, tuned to your taste, your calendar, and the weather.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://cherly.app\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Cherly\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Privacy Policy · Cherly\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Cherly turns photos of your real clothes into an AI stylist — complete outfits from clothes you actually own, tuned to your taste, your calendar, and the weather.\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js?dpl=dpl_2cHwHoT8cpbtWpDFw1rADLbhHx5f\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 px-4 pt-4\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-5xl items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-full border border-line/80 bg-surface/80 py-2.5 pl-5 pr-2.5 shadow-artsy backdrop-blur-xl\"><a class=\"font-serif text-2xl italic tracking-tight text-brand-700 transition-opacity hover:opacity-80\" href=\"/\">Cherly</a><nav class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-sm sm:gap-2\"><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-foreground/70 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-100 hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-foreground/70 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-100 hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/support\">Support</a><a class=\"rounded-full bg-brand-500 px-4 py-1.5 font-medium text-white shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-brand-600\" href=\"/#waitlist\">Get the app</a></nav></div></header><main class=\"min-h-[70vh]\"><article class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-20 [&amp;_a]:text-brand-700 [&amp;_h1]:font-serif [&amp;_h1]:text-4xl [&amp;_h1]:italic [&amp;_h1]:tracking-tight [&amp;_h2]:mt-10 [&amp;_h2]:font-serif [&amp;_h2]:text-xl [&amp;_h2]:italic [&amp;_p]:mt-4 [&amp;_p]:leading-relaxed [&amp;_p]:text-foreground/80 [&amp;_ul]:mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-2 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ul]:text-foreground/80\"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class=\"text-sm\">Last updated <!-- -->July 22, 2026</p><p>Cherly<!-- --> is a wardrobe and styling app. This policy explains what we collect, why, and what happens to it.</p><h2>What we collect</h2><ul><li>Your email address, so you can sign in.</li><li>Photos you add — clothing photos and outfit photos. They are stored privately in your account and are only visible to you.</li><li>The wardrobe data derived from those photos (categories, colours, tags), your saved outfits, wear history, events you create, and your style preferences.</li><li>Your subscription status, so we know which plan you are on.</li><li>Usage and crash data, to find what is broken and what is worth improving.</li></ul><h2>How AI processing works</h2><p>When you add a photo, we send it to trusted processors to remove the background and to recognise the garment (currently PhotoRoom and OpenAI). When you ask for outfit suggestions or chat with the stylist, descriptions of your wardrobe — not your photos — are sent to OpenAI to generate the response. These processors handle your data under their own privacy commitments and do not use it to train their models per our agreements. Your photos are never shared publicly or sold.</p><h2>Weather and calendar</h2><p>If you attach a place to an event, we look up the weather forecast for that place. If you connect your calendar (Pro), events are read from your device to plan outfits — we store only what is needed to style you.</p><h2>What we never do</h2><p>We do not sell your data, and we do not share it with advertisers.</p><h2>Deleting your data</h2><p>You can delete your account from inside the app (Settings → Delete account) or from the<!-- --> <a class=\"underline\" href=\"/support/delete-account\">deletion page</a>. Deletion removes your photos, wardrobe, and history. It is immediate and permanent.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions: privacy@<!-- -->cherly.app</p><!--$--><!--/$--></article></main><footer class=\"mt-24 border-t border-line\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col gap-6 px-5 py-10 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><div><p class=\"font-serif text-xl italic text-brand-700\">Cherly</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-foreground/50\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Cherly<!-- --> · <!-- -->Your closet, styled by AI.</p></div><nav class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-sm\"><a class=\"text-foreground/60 transition-colors hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/legal/privacy\">Privacy</a><a class=\"text-foreground/60 transition-colors hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/legal/terms\">Terms</a><a class=\"text-foreground/60 transition-colors hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/support\">Support</a><a class=\"text-foreground/60 transition-colors hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/support/delete-account\">Delete account</a></nav></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3yiddnbtmgj46.js?dpl=dpl_2cHwHoT8cpbtWpDFw1rADLbhHx5f\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js?dpl=dpl_2cHwHoT8cpbtWpDFw1rADLbhHx5f\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js?dpl=dpl_2cHwHoT8cpbtWpDFw1rADLbhHx5f\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js?dpl=dpl_2cHwHoT8cpbtWpDFw1rADLbhHx5f\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js?dpl=dpl_2cHwHoT8cpbtWpDFw1rADLbhHx5f\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js?d